://steamcommunity.com/id/mettaworldpeece/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2060, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1718, "last_played": 1492107182, "avatar": "b54dd3c4a19587d071aff854e67a6ee84fedf73f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am very fond of co-op games and this is one of the best I've ever played.  On harder levels you need to play together as a team or you will die all the time.  The different classes add a new aspect of teamwork and the limited ammo makes camping nearly impossible.  It is a great mix of fast-pace strategy and shooting.\n\nPros:\n-Great graphics\n-Unique gameplay\n-Free\n-Great co-op\n\nCons:\n-Short campaign\n-Not enough servers", "timestamp_created": 1328851385, "timestamp_updated": 1468518742, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}